{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Haveo, a knight on his way to the city of Lavyn. However he finds himself cursed by a strange object he discovered in a dilapidated fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now forced to expand a strange entity's influence by activating and defending stone cores he needs to explore Lavyn and its surroundings to try and find a way to free himself.\u00a0 Fight your way through adversaries and creatures who will try to stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To aid you in your quest you will need to gather allies and discover new abilities, as well as tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore and discover the secrets of Lavyn and its surroundings.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find the stone cores and protect them in battles.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wooden workers will help you build defences during battles.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build mighty towers with different offensive and economical constructs.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Increase your strength by gathering materials and offer them to ancient beings.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trade with merchants.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Befriend characters who will aid Haveo in his mission.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Pixelart visuals layered in a 3D space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix between Metroidvania and Tower Defense / RTS.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2348500?t=1771927078","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2348500?t=1771927078","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348500/f2e84f88853